We&nbsp;take play seriously. We’re looking for curious adventurers ready to find their party, fueled by imagination&nbsp;and drive&nbsp;to build what’s never been built before. At Hasbro and Wizards of the Coast, you’ll collaborate with passionate teams to reimagine our iconic brands and create experiences that spark joy, connection, and community through the magic of play. This is your chance to shape legendary play that lasts a lifetime.

This is a unique opportunity to help build the future of learning at Hasbro, creating a development ecosystem that strengthens leadership, accelerates business-critical capabilities, and delivers learning experiences that are distinctly Hasbro.&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;

The Director of Learning &amp; Career Development will lead the design, development, and delivery of learning experiences that help our people grow and our business succeed. From onboarding and manager excellence to leadership development, workforce capability building, and differentiated talent programs, this leader will shape the learning experiences that support employees throughout their careers at Hasbro. &nbsp;

This is a highly visible role that requires strategic thinking, sound judgment, and hands-on execution. The ideal candidate is a builder who can create a roadmap, earn alignment, develop a team, roll up their sleeves, and bring programs to life. They are equally comfortable facilitating a leadership session, designing a new program, partnering with senior leaders, or leveraging technology and AI to scale impact across a global workforce.&nbsp; &nbsp;

&nbsp;

A Day in the Life:

• Design &amp; Execute Learning Strategy: Develop and evolve Hasbro's learning and career development roadmap, applying sound judgment to prioritize where we invest so learning supports business priorities, workforce needs, and employee growth.&nbsp;

• Partner Across the Business: Collaborate as a true team player with leaders, HR partners, and employees globally to assess capability needs, identify development opportunities, and create solutions that help teams and individuals perform at their best.&nbsp;

• Build &amp; Deliver Learning Programs: Lead the design, development, facilitation, and delivery of high-impact learning experiences including onboarding, early career programs, manager excellence, leadership development, mentorship, coaching, and differentiated talent initiatives.&nbsp;

• Create Signature Hasbro Learning Experiences: Build distinctive, Hasbro-curated development experiences that strengthen culture, reinforce what great looks like at Hasbro, and help attract, engage, and retain top talent. Leverage internal expertise, executive involvement, business acumen, and the creativity of our brands to create learning experiences employees cannot get anywhere else. &nbsp;&nbsp;

• Build Critical Workforce Capabilities: Partner with business leaders to identify emerging skill needs and design scalable solutions that strengthen key capabilities such as AI, digital fluency, business acumen, leadership, and other enterprise priorities. &nbsp;

• Leverage Technology &amp; AI to Scale Impact: Champion innovative learning technologies, AI-enabled tools, and emerging delivery methods that create engaging learning experiences, improve personalization, and extend the reach of a lean team. Continuously explore new approaches to learning and capability building.&nbsp;

• Activate Leaders as Teachers: Partner with executives and leaders to serve as teachers, mentors, coaches, and champions for learning across the organization.

• Integrate Learning with Talent, Culture &amp; Inclusion: Collaborate across HR and business teams to embed learning into talent management, leadership expectations, performance practices, engagement, succession planning, and belonging initiatives.&nbsp;

